'''Default Knife''' is a {{C|Common|common}} knife that is given to the player the first time they join [[Murder Mystery 2]], along with [[Default Gun]]. It is currently the only non-{{C|Unique|unique}} weapon in the game that cannot be [[Trading|traded]] or otherwise removed from your [[inventory]] along with [[Default Gun]]. 

== Appearance ==
Default Knife has a black and slate-gray blade, with a gold guard and a black handle. It is the original Roblox knife skin, similar to a real kitchen knife   

== Trivia ==
* Default Knife is not the original default knife given to players in [[Murder Mystery]]; instead, players were given the [[Classic Knife]].
* Default Knife is the base for most of the knife skins from [[Common Weapons|Common]] to [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]].
* Default Knife's model is derived from [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/121946387/Bombos-Survival-Knife Bombo's Survival Knife], a gear made by Roblox that is purchasable for 100 robux in the avatar shop.
* The first time that this knife was seen in Murder Mystery was on the [[Hospital (MM1)|Hospital]] map.
* The Default Knife may disappear for players who started playing a long time ago.
* Many users such as [[Thexz]], a youtuber, do not own this knife or the [[Default Gun]] because their inventory was wiped. In Thexz's case, he wanted a clean inventory.
* [[Corrupt]] is the only knife above the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] tier that uses the Default Knife's mesh/model.
* This is technically the most common knife.

